@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed independent Git, execution and deployment admission
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized actor" as A
participant Git
participant "Workflow coordinator" as W
participant "Evaluated executor" as E
participant "Trusted target adapter" as T
A -> Git : native transfer / exact revision-bound merge intent
Git -> Git : current credential / ref / review checks
Git --> A : actual native ref result or conflict
opt supported authorized trigger only
 Git -> W : attributable exact code / definition event context
 W -> W : current run authority + isolation / resource / secret gates
 alt execution admitted
  W -> E : durable scoped attempt identity
  E --> W : attributable outcome / output / cleanup evidence
 else blocked / denied
  W --> A : no admitted execution; actual gate finding
 end
end
== Separate exact-artifact target approval ==
A -> W : target approval / artifact / configuration / recovery context
W -> W : current target authority + guarded approval inputs
alt deployment admitted
 W -> T : separate stable target attempt
 T --> W : confirmed / partial / unknown effect evidence
 W --> A : actual deployment outcome; reconcile uncertainty
else denied / stale / unavailable
 W --> A : no admitted deployment
end
note over Git,T
 Associations and events convey no inherited permissions.
 No automatic deploy from merge or run success.
 Concrete coordination follows owning component contracts.
end note
@enduml
